flowchart TD
  H[Human UI] --> CMD[Application command service]
  W[WebMCP callback] --> CMD
  M[MCP adapter] --> CMD
  A[A2A worker] --> CMD
  CMD --> POL[Current policy and preconditions]
  POL --> STATE[Authoritative state]
  STATE --> PROJ[Principal-specific projection]
  PROJ --> H
  PROJ --> W
  PROJ --> M
  STATE --> EVT[Correlated completion or task event]
